&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editions, our network of delivery-only kitchens, is a key differentiator in France commercial ambition. &lt;/strong&gt;The Account Management Lead – Editions France role is created as part of a wider reorganisation of the Editions business as part of our regional strategy. The role reports to Paris regional leadership and is designed to combine strategic partner leadership, P&amp;amp;L ownership and organisation building across the Editions network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Account Management Lead – Editions France&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the Editions commercial team for France constituted of Senior Account Managers, Account Managers and Sales Managers. You will be the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, accountable for its coordination and its execution on the ground, growing the performance and profitability of our sites while driving occupancy and the differentiation Editions brings to the French market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L. That means holding the commercial scorecard for new kitchens, making financial decisions with a clear view of both partner and Deliveroo profitability, and steering your team&#39;s portfolio towards sustainable growth rather than volume alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for the development plan for your team, their success and learning curve at Deliveroo; setting the right KPIs and OKRs to monitor the business. Your role will be commercially focused, however Editions is as much a project management discipline as a commercial one: you will work hand in hand with Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction, Kitchen Layout, Site Operations, Marketing and the International Editions team to bring kitchens live and keep them performing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Editions Strategy &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, ensuring its coordination across teams and its disciplined execution site by site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead your team&#39;s portfolio strategy, growing the performance and profitability of each Editions site in line with agreed targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop the business so that it fits within, and contributes to, the wider regional strategy, bringing the specificity of the French network to regional and international forums&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and deliver joint business plans with restaurant partners, identifying growth and profitability opportunities, defining mutual goals and finding compelling ways to solve them (menu optimisation, virtual brands, pricing, packaging, catchment expansion)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with the Media team to identify and negotiate revenue opportunities to generate additional value from Editions sites&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occupancy &amp;amp; Commercial Performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the occupancy trajectory of the French network, partnering closely with Local teams to positively drive occupancy and secure signed contracts within agreed timelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and enforce the Editions commercial scorecard for new kitchens, profitability checks against P&amp;amp;L guidelines, launch package, site specificities, ensuring the process is applied consistently across the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steer the lead generation and pipeline process, mapping high-potential restaurants and cuisine gaps by site, and mobilising other commercial stakeholders to qualify interest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead commercial negotiations with business owners and C-suite operators, supporting proposals with a robust P&amp;amp;L rationale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P&amp;amp;L Ownership &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L, accountable for revenue, profitability and the financial health of your perimeter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set, own and deliver performance targets across occupancy, partner health, site profitability and Deliveroo output metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a clear operating rhythm on reporting, velocity, sign-to-live, occupancy and sales reviews, and use it to make decisions, not just to describe results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kitchen Launches &amp;amp; Cross-functional Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Site Managers, Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction and Kitchen Layout teams to secure the successful build and launch of new kitchens&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with Global team on kitchen implementation, and with Marketing and Operations on launch packages, so that every opening lands on time and performs from week one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage and oversee project execution end to end, including B2B communication and cross-business-unit workshops&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propose process optimisation and automation: Deliveroo moves fast, and you will improve the processes that let Editions scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the senior point of contact and face of Deliveroo Editions for top restaurant partners, building trusted, long-term relationships and representing Deliveroo at partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a strong operating rhythm with partners, including quarterly business reviews and monthly performance check-ins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior stakeholders, providing strategic insights on Deliveroo, competitors and broader industry trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership: Support and coach your Account Managers and Sales Managers to build and execute strong commercial and operational plans, and to raise the standard of account management across the Editions network&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years working in commercially focused roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing medium-sized commercial or account management teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly analytical, with proven P&amp;amp;L ownership or strong financial decision-making experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid project management skills, with a track record of delivering complex, cross-functional projects on time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mix of both strategy and execution experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable handling negotiations with business owners or C-suite operators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective collaborator, able to influence internal stakeholders across functions and geographies, including global teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relationship-building and communication skills whether face-to-face, through phone or email&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptable and comfortable working in a rapidly changing environment; proactive and creative problem solver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a passion for food and operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be in the field often, which will require travel (depending on the needs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous general management experience, or experience running your own business would be desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent in French and English is required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a founding member of the Security Operations team in EMEA, you will join us at an exciting time in Roblox’s SIRT &amp;amp; SOC program. You will design and build the detections, automation and tooling that let a lean team monitor and protect players, developers, employees and the platform at global scale and serve as security incident commander in the region. This is a highly autonomous role where you will be a primary decision-maker, core to our mission to maintain a highly capable 24/7/365 monitoring and response capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While you will work in close collaboration with peers at our US West Coast Headquarters, the time difference requires an engineer who can operate independently, making critical decisions without immediate oversight. We favor engineering our way out of toil through automation, orchestration, detections-as-code, and risk-based prioritization,&amp;nbsp;while retaining the deep technical skills required to conduct detailed, hands-on analysis and lead response end-to-end when the situation warrants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based in London, UK. You will be working from a dedicated, private space located within a shared office environment, designed to enable collaboration while remaining secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Detection &amp;amp; Response Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, write, and maintain production-quality detections, automations and integrations (detections-as-code, SOAR playbooks, data and enrichment pipelines) that scale our monitoring capability and reduce manual toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Tooling &amp;amp; Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and improve the tooling the global SIRT/SOC depends on alert quality and enrichment, case-management integrations and automation that powers reliable &quot;follow-the-sun&quot; hand-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise High Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary Incident Commander for the European time zone, making critical, time-sensitive decisions independently before US HQ comes online. You will serve as the senior-most security engineering point of contact in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategy &amp;amp; Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape the technical direction of the detection &amp;amp; response engineering function, specifically architecting how global hand-offs and &quot;follow-the-sun&quot; models can be optimized and automated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command Security Incidents:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure serious threats and impacts are understood, mitigated, and learned from with speed and professionalism, often leading responses end-to-end without immediate escalation paths during local hours — and turning what you learn into durable, automated detections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct Forensic Investigations &amp;amp; Threat Hunt:&lt;/strong&gt; Dig into complex context to determine whether threats exist, take decisive action and proactively hunt for anomalous activity in our signals, distinguishing outliers from threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead High-Profile Responses:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Security and Engineering to lead responses to major vulnerabilities or platform-wide events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Legal, HR, Executive teams, and external partners (Developers &amp;amp; Customers). You will also travel semi-regularly to the USA to visit HQ, ensuring deep alignment with central engineering and security leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years across security engineering, Infosec, IT, Infra/SRE, and/or Incident Response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialization:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years specifically in Detection or Response, with a track record of &lt;em&gt;building&lt;/em&gt;, writing detections, automation or security tooling, not solely operating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable writing and reviewing production-quality code (Scripting) and building automations, integrations and data pipelines that others depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to work independently in satellite offices or distributed teams. You are comfortable being the &quot;person in charge&quot; during your shift and making calls that impact the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Command:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience operating as an incident commander. You can flex into deep engineering work but also possess the executive presence to coordinate responders and communicate status to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigations:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level capability investigating threats in enterprise and production environments, taking ownership from identification to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge/Tools/Techniques:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of security tooling (SIEM, EDR, IDS/IPS, NDR, SOAR) and experience extending or building on it. You are proficient in applying Incident Response frameworks (NIST IR Lifecycle, Cyber Kill Chain, MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK) to real-world scenarios, and you collaborate effectively with engineering colleagues, leveraging extensive expertise across infrastructure and technologies (Public Cloud, OS, Virtualization, Containerization, Networking, Build/Development infrastructure, and Hardware).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Cybersecurity, or a related technical field; advanced degree preferred or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Builder-Operator:&lt;/strong&gt; You would rather automate a problem out of existence than staff around it and you hold yourself to an engineering bar even under incident pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Strategic Self-Starter:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait for instructions. You identify gaps in coverage — especially those unique to regional or time-zone-specific challenges — and fix them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Detailed Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy exploring the details and considering the second- and third-order effects of your decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Eager Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are drawn to complex issues rather than avoidant of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emboldened to Make Change:&lt;/strong&gt; You instinctively ask what you can do to improve the situation rather than waiting to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelled by our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; You are driven by the opportunity to protect our community and the safe space we&#39;ve created.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Calculated Risk Taker:&lt;/strong&gt; You move fast, navigating reasonable risks to take action and build capabilities as quickly as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
