&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll be embedded into the Metadata Systems Engineering team and will work with software developers, traders, and operations professionals across the firm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
